{"seq":3,"slug":"module-systems-and-resolution","title":"模块系统与解析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/foundations/module-systems-and-resolution","wordCount":1057,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"模块系统与解析\">模块系统与解析</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇讨论两个彼此耦合的主题：模块系统（代码如何声明依赖与导出）与模块解析（模块说明符如何映射到文件系统路径）。CommonJS 与 ES Modules 是当前并存的两大规范，前者运行时解析、值拷贝，后者编译时静态分析、值引用绑定——这一差异直接决定了 Tree-shaking、代码分割等优化能否成立。模块解析则由运行时的查找算法与 <code>package.json</code> 的 <code>exports</code> 条件导出共同决定，打包器在此之上又叠加了别名、扩展名补全等增强。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"javascript-模块化的演进\">JavaScript 模块化的演进</h2><p>JavaScript 最初被设计为简单的浏览器脚本语言，没有内置的模块系统。所有代码共享全局作用域，这在大型项目中导致了严重的命名冲突和依赖管理问题。社区驱动的模块化方案应运而生，最终演化为今天的标准化模块系统。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"timeline\" data-source=\"timeline&#10;    title JavaScript 模块化演进&#10;    2009 : CommonJS (Node.js)&#10;    2011 : AMD (RequireJS)&#10;    2011 : UMD (通用模块)&#10;    2015 : ES Modules (ES6 标准)&#10;    2018 : Node.js 实验性支持 ESM&#10;    2021 : Node.js 稳定支持 ESM&#10;    2024 : ESM 成为主流标准\">timeline\n    title JavaScript 模块化演进\n    2009 : CommonJS (Node.js)\n    2011 : AMD (RequireJS)\n    2011 : UMD (通用模块)\n    2015 : ES Modules (ES6 标准)\n    2018 : Node.js 实验性支持 ESM\n    2021 : Node.js 稳定支持 ESM\n    2024 : ESM 成为主流标准</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"commonjs-cjs\">CommonJS (CJS)</h2><p>CommonJS 是 Node.js 采用的模块规范。它的核心特征是<strong>同步加载</strong>和<strong>运行时解析</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基本语法\">基本语法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// math.js - 导出&#10;const PI = 3.14159265;&#10;&#10;function add(a, b) {&#10;  return a + b;&#10;}&#10;&#10;function multiply(a, b) {&#10;  return a * b;&#10;}&#10;&#10;module.exports = { PI, add, multiply };\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// math.js - 导出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> PI</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3.14159265</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> multiply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exports</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { PI, add, multiply };</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// app.js - 导入&#10;const { add, multiply } = require(&#39;./math&#39;);&#10;&#10;console.log(add(1, 2));&#10;console.log(multiply(3, 4));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app.js - 导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">multiply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> require</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./math'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">multiply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"commonjs-的运行时特性\">CommonJS 的运行时特性</h3><p>CommonJS 模块在首次 <code>require</code> 时被执行，执行结果被缓存。后续的 <code>require</code> 调用直接返回缓存值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// counter.js&#10;let count = 0;&#10;&#10;module.exports = {&#10;  increment() {&#10;    count++;&#10;  },&#10;  getCount() {&#10;    return count;&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// counter.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">exports</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  getCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// a.js&#10;const counter = require(&#39;./counter&#39;);&#10;counter.increment();&#10;counter.increment();&#10;console.log(counter.getCount()); // 2&#10;&#10;// b.js - 即使在不同文件中引入，共享同一个实例&#10;const counter = require(&#39;./counter&#39;);&#10;console.log(counter.getCount()); // 2 (共享缓存)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// a.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> counter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> require</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./counter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">counter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(counter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// b.js - 即使在不同文件中引入，共享同一个实例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> counter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> require</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./counter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(counter.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2 (共享缓存)</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"commonjs-的缓存机制\">CommonJS 的缓存机制</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    REQ[require &#39;./module&#39;]&#10;    CACHE{模块在缓存中?}&#10;    LOAD[加载文件]&#10;    COMPILE[编译为函数]&#10;    EXEC[执行模块代码]&#10;    STORE[存入缓存]&#10;    RETURN[返回 module.exports]&#10;&#10;    REQ --&gt; CACHE&#10;    CACHE --&gt;|是| RETURN&#10;    CACHE --&gt;|否| LOAD&#10;    LOAD --&gt; COMPILE&#10;    COMPILE --&gt; EXEC&#10;    EXEC --&gt; STORE&#10;    STORE --&gt; RETURN\">flowchart TD\n    REQ[require './module']\n    CACHE{模块在缓存中?}\n    LOAD[加载文件]\n    COMPILE[编译为函数]\n    EXEC[执行模块代码]\n    STORE[存入缓存]\n    RETURN[返回 module.exports]\n\n    REQ --&gt; CACHE\n    CACHE --&gt;|是| RETURN\n    CACHE --&gt;|否| LOAD\n    LOAD --&gt; COMPILE\n    COMPILE --&gt; EXEC\n    EXEC --&gt; STORE\n    STORE --&gt; RETURN</pre><p>CommonJS 的关键限制在于：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>同步加载</td>\n<td>require 是同步操作，阻塞后续代码</td>\n<td>不适合浏览器环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时解析</td>\n<td>导出值在运行时确定</td>\n<td>无法进行静态分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>值的拷贝</td>\n<td>require 获取的是导出值的拷贝</td>\n<td>无法感知原模块的后续修改</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态导入</td>\n<td>require 路径可以是变量或表达式</td>\n<td>打包器难以确定依赖关系</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"es-modules-esm\">ES Modules (ESM)</h2><p>ES Modules 是 ECMAScript 2015（ES6）引入的官方模块标准。与 CommonJS 不同，ESM 采用<strong>静态结构</strong>和<strong>编译时分析</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基本语法\">基本语法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// math.js - 命名导出&#10;export const PI = 3.14159265;&#10;&#10;export function add(a, b) {&#10;  return a + b;&#10;}&#10;&#10;export function multiply(a, b) {&#10;  return a * b;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 默认导出&#10;export default class Calculator {&#10;  evaluate(expr) {&#10;    return eval(expr);&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// math.js - 命名导出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> PI</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3.14159265</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> multiply</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">a</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">b</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 默认导出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Calculator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  evaluate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> eval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(expr);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// app.js - 命名导入&#10;import { add, multiply, PI } from &#39;./math.js&#39;;&#10;import Calculator from &#39;./math.js&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 整体导入&#10;import * as math from &#39;./math.js&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 动态导入&#10;const module = await import(&#39;./math.js&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app.js - 命名导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { add, multiply, PI } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './math.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Calculator </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './math.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 整体导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> math </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './math.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 动态导入</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> module</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./math.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"esm-的静态特性\">ESM 的静态特性</h3><p>ESM 最核心的设计决策是<strong>静态结构</strong>：<code>import</code> 和 <code>export</code> 语句必须出现在模块顶层，不能嵌套在条件语句或函数中。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 合法 - 顶层 import&#10;import { add } from &#39;./math.js&#39;;&#10;&#10;// 不合法 - 条件 import&#10;if (condition) {&#10;  import { add } from &#39;./math.js&#39;; // SyntaxError&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 动态导入使用 import() 函数&#10;if (condition) {&#10;  const { add } = await import(&#39;./math.js&#39;); // 合法&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 合法 - 顶层 import</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { add } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './math.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不合法 - 条件 import</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (condition) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { add } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './math.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// SyntaxError</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 动态导入使用 import() 函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (condition) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./math.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 合法</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种静态结构使得打包器可以在不执行代码的情况下，通过<strong>静态分析</strong>确定完整的依赖图——这正是 Tree-shaking 的基础。</p>\n<h3 id=\"esm-与-cjs-的核心差异\">ESM 与 CJS 的核心差异</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph CommonJS&#10;        direction TB&#10;        CJS_LOAD[运行时加载] --&gt; CJS_COPY[值的拷贝]&#10;        CJS_COPY --&gt; CJS_SYNC[同步执行]&#10;        CJS_SYNC --&gt; CJS_DYNAMIC[支持动态路径]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph ES Modules&#10;        direction TB&#10;        ESM_PARSE[编译时分析] --&gt; ESM_REF[值的引用/绑定]&#10;        ESM_REF --&gt; ESM_ASYNC[异步加载]&#10;        ESM_ASYNC --&gt; ESM_STATIC[静态路径]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph CommonJS\n        direction TB\n        CJS_LOAD[运行时加载] --&gt; CJS_COPY[值的拷贝]\n        CJS_COPY --&gt; CJS_SYNC[同步执行]\n        CJS_SYNC --&gt; CJS_DYNAMIC[支持动态路径]\n    end\n    subgraph ES Modules\n        direction TB\n        ESM_PARSE[编译时分析] --&gt; ESM_REF[值的引用/绑定]\n        ESM_REF --&gt; ESM_ASYNC[异步加载]\n        ESM_ASYNC --&gt; ESM_STATIC[静态路径]\n    end</pre><p><strong>值的拷贝 vs 值的引用</strong>是 CJS 和 ESM 最关键的区别：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// counter.mjs (ESM)&#10;export let count = 0;&#10;&#10;export function increment() {&#10;  count++;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// counter.mjs (ESM)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// app.mjs (ESM)&#10;import { count, increment } from &#39;./counter.mjs&#39;;&#10;&#10;console.log(count); // 0&#10;increment();&#10;increment();&#10;console.log(count); // 2 — ESM 是引用绑定，能看到原模块的变化\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// app.mjs (ESM)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { count, increment } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './counter.mjs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(count); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">log</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(count); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 2 — ESM 是引用绑定，能看到原模块的变化</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在 CommonJS 中，相同场景的 <code>count</code> 始终是初始值 0，因为 <code>require</code> 获取的是值的拷贝。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"模块解析算法\">模块解析算法</h2><p>当代码中出现 <code>import &#39;lodash&#39;</code> 或 <code>require(&#39;./utils&#39;)</code> 时，运行时和打包器需要将这些模块说明符（Module Specifier）解析为文件系统中的实际路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"node-js-模块解析\">Node.js 模块解析</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    SPEC[模块说明符]&#10;    IS_RELATIVE{以 ./ 或 ../ 开头?}&#10;    IS_ABSOLUTE{是绝对路径?}&#10;    IS_BUILTIN{是内置模块?}&#10;&#10;    SPEC --&gt; IS_RELATIVE&#10;    IS_RELATIVE --&gt;|是| RESOLVE_FILE[解析为相对路径文件]&#10;    IS_RELATIVE --&gt;|否| IS_ABSOLUTE&#10;    IS_ABSOLUTE --&gt;|是| RESOLVE_ABS[直接使用绝对路径]&#10;    IS_ABSOLUTE --&gt;|否| IS_BUILTIN&#10;    IS_BUILTIN --&gt;|是| LOAD_BUILTIN[加载内置模块]&#10;    IS_BUILTIN --&gt;|否| RESOLVE_NM[在 node_modules 中查找]&#10;&#10;    RESOLVE_FILE --&gt; TRY[尝试路径扩展]&#10;    RESOLVE_NM --&gt; TRY_NM[逐级向上查找 node_modules]\">flowchart TD\n    SPEC[模块说明符]\n    IS_RELATIVE{以 ./ 或 ../ 开头?}\n    IS_ABSOLUTE{是绝对路径?}\n    IS_BUILTIN{是内置模块?}\n\n    SPEC --&gt; IS_RELATIVE\n    IS_RELATIVE --&gt;|是| RESOLVE_FILE[解析为相对路径文件]\n    IS_RELATIVE --&gt;|否| IS_ABSOLUTE\n    IS_ABSOLUTE --&gt;|是| RESOLVE_ABS[直接使用绝对路径]\n    IS_ABSOLUTE --&gt;|否| IS_BUILTIN\n    IS_BUILTIN --&gt;|是| LOAD_BUILTIN[加载内置模块]\n    IS_BUILTIN --&gt;|否| RESOLVE_NM[在 node_modules 中查找]\n\n    RESOLVE_FILE --&gt; TRY[尝试路径扩展]\n    RESOLVE_NM --&gt; TRY_NM[逐级向上查找 node_modules]</pre><p>对于裸模块说明符（如 <code>lodash</code>），Node.js 的查找策略是从当前目录开始，逐级向上查找 <code>node_modules</code> 目录：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"/project/src/utils/helper.js 中 require(&#39;lodash&#39;)&#10;&#10;查找顺序：&#10;1. /project/src/utils/node_modules/lodash&#10;2. /project/src/node_modules/lodash&#10;3. /project/node_modules/lodash&#10;4. /node_modules/lodash\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>/project/src/utils/helper.js 中 require('lodash')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>查找顺序：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>1. /project/src/utils/node_modules/lodash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>2. /project/src/node_modules/lodash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>3. /project/node_modules/lodash</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>4. /node_modules/lodash</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"package-json-中的导出映射\">package.json 中的导出映射</h3><p>现代 Node.js 引入了 <code>exports</code> 字段，为包提供了精确的导出控制：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;name&quot;: &quot;my-library&quot;,&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;module&quot;,&#10;  &quot;main&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.cjs&quot;,&#10;  &quot;module&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.mjs&quot;,&#10;  &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.d.ts&quot;,&#10;  &quot;exports&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;.&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.d.ts&quot;,&#10;      &quot;import&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.mjs&quot;,&#10;      &quot;require&quot;: &quot;./dist/index.cjs&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;./utils&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;types&quot;: &quot;./dist/utils.d.ts&quot;,&#10;      &quot;import&quot;: &quot;./dist/utils.mjs&quot;,&#10;      &quot;require&quot;: &quot;./dist/utils.cjs&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"my-library\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"main\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.cjs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"module\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.mjs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.d.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"exports\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \".\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.d.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"import\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.mjs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"require\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/index.cjs\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"./utils\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"types\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/utils.d.ts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"import\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/utils.mjs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"require\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"./dist/utils.cjs\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>exports</code> 字段支持条件导出，打包器和运行时根据环境选择合适的入口：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条件</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>import</code></td>\n<td>通过 ESM import 加载时使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>require</code></td>\n<td>通过 CJS require 加载时使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>types</code></td>\n<td>TypeScript 类型声明</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>default</code></td>\n<td>兜底条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>browser</code></td>\n<td>浏览器环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>node</code></td>\n<td>Node.js 环境</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"打包器的增强解析\">打包器的增强解析</h3><p>打包器在 Node.js 解析算法基础上提供了更多功能：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// webpack.config.js / rspack.config.js&#10;export default {&#10;  resolve: {&#10;    extensions: [&#39;.ts&#39;, &#39;.tsx&#39;, &#39;.js&#39;, &#39;.jsx&#39;],&#10;    alias: {&#10;      &#39;@&#39;: &#39;/src&#39;,&#10;      &#39;@components&#39;: &#39;/src/components&#39;,&#10;      &#39;@utils&#39;: &#39;/src/utils&#39;,&#10;    },&#10;    mainFields: [&#39;module&#39;, &#39;main&#39;],&#10;    conditionNames: [&#39;import&#39;, &#39;module&#39;, &#39;browser&#39;, &#39;default&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// webpack.config.js / rspack.config.js</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  resolve: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    extensions: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.ts'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.tsx'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.js'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'.jsx'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    alias: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '@'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/src'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '@components'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/src/components'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      '@utils'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'/src/utils'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    mainFields: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'module'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'main'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    conditionNames: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'import'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'module'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'browser'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'default'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// tsconfig.json 中的路径映射&#10;{&#10;  &quot;compilerOptions&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;baseUrl&quot;: &quot;.&quot;,&#10;    &quot;paths&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;@/*&quot;: [&quot;src/*&quot;],&#10;      &quot;@components/*&quot;: [&quot;src/components/*&quot;],&#10;      &quot;@utils/*&quot;: [&quot;src/utils/*&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// tsconfig.json 中的路径映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  \"compilerOptions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"baseUrl\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"paths\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"@/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"@components/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/components/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      \"@utils/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"src/utils/*\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"双模块系统的互操作\">双模块系统的互操作</h2><p>在现实项目中，CJS 和 ESM 模块经常需要互操作。这是构建工具链中最复杂的问题之一。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph ESM 模块&#10;        ESM_IMPORT[import]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph CJS 模块&#10;        CJS_REQUIRE[require]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    ESM_IMPORT --&gt;|可以导入 CJS| CJS_REQUIRE&#10;    CJS_REQUIRE --&gt;|不能同步 require ESM| ESM_IMPORT&#10;    CJS_REQUIRE -.-&gt;|可以用 import 动态导入| ESM_IMPORT\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph ESM 模块\n        ESM_IMPORT[import]\n    end\n    subgraph CJS 模块\n        CJS_REQUIRE[require]\n    end\n\n    ESM_IMPORT --&gt;|可以导入 CJS| CJS_REQUIRE\n    CJS_REQUIRE --&gt;|不能同步 require ESM| ESM_IMPORT\n    CJS_REQUIRE -.-&gt;|可以用 import 动态导入| ESM_IMPORT</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// ESM 中导入 CJS 模块&#10;import cjsModule from &#39;./legacy.cjs&#39;; // 默认导入获取 module.exports&#10;import { named } from &#39;./legacy.cjs&#39;; // 命名导入（Node.js 会尝试静态分析）&#10;&#10;// CJS 中使用 ESM 模块&#10;const esmModule = await import(&#39;./modern.mjs&#39;); // 只能使用动态 import()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ESM 中导入 CJS 模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cjsModule </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './legacy.cjs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 默认导入获取 module.exports</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { named } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> './legacy.cjs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 命名导入（Node.js 会尝试静态分析）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// CJS 中使用 ESM 模块</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> esmModule</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./modern.mjs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 只能使用动态 import()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>打包器通常会自动处理这种互操作，但理解底层机制有助于排查一些棘手的模块兼容性问题。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CommonJS 采用同步加载、运行时解析、值拷贝，是 Node.js 的传统模块系统。</li>\n<li>ES Modules 采用静态结构、编译时分析、值引用，是 JavaScript 的官方标准。</li>\n<li>模块解析算法决定了模块说明符如何映射到文件系统路径。</li>\n<li><code>package.json</code> 的 <code>exports</code> 字段提供了精确的条件导出控制。</li>\n<li>打包器在标准解析算法上增加了路径别名、扩展名补全等增强功能。</li>\n<li>CJS 和 ESM 的互操作是构建工具链中的常见难点。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"模块系统与解析","id":"模块系统与解析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"JavaScript 模块化的演进","id":"javascript-模块化的演进"},{"level":2,"text":"CommonJS (CJS)","id":"commonjs-cjs"},{"level":3,"text":"基本语法","id":"基本语法"},{"level":3,"text":"CommonJS 的运行时特性","id":"commonjs-的运行时特性"},{"level":3,"text":"CommonJS 的缓存机制","id":"commonjs-的缓存机制"},{"level":2,"text":"ES Modules (ESM)","id":"es-modules-esm"},{"level":3,"text":"基本语法","id":"基本语法"},{"level":3,"text":"ESM 的静态特性","id":"esm-的静态特性"},{"level":3,"text":"ESM 与 CJS 的核心差异","id":"esm-与-cjs-的核心差异"},{"level":2,"text":"模块解析算法","id":"模块解析算法"},{"level":3,"text":"Node.js 模块解析","id":"node-js-模块解析"},{"level":3,"text":"package.json 中的导出映射","id":"package-json-中的导出映射"},{"level":3,"text":"打包器的增强解析","id":"打包器的增强解析"},{"level":2,"text":"双模块系统的互操作","id":"双模块系统的互操作"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"编译、打包与转译","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/foundations/compilation-vs-bundling-vs-transpiling"},"next":{"title":"Webpack 核心概念","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/build-toolchain/bundlers/webpack-core-concepts"}}